        <mxCell id="GounX5kbPWO2UAfJvxkh-25" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Panic Room&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;North, East, South, and West rooms are all accessible from each other. West, East, and South lead to portals to different universes (albeit generic ones). West leads to some card game players in a Western / Wild West world, South leads to a scientist in a Sci-Fi world, East leads to a farmer in a Fantasy world. Helping all the people by solving their puzzles grants an item and all three items must be used to access the rhythm game. The game is placed on a timer -- running out of time fails the game. Failing the rhythm game at the end also fails the game.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
